            <ArticleTitle>Evaluation and management of maladaptive behaviors and psychological issues in temporomandibular disorder patients.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>341-54</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article presents an overview of some of the behavioral and psychosocial issues involved in the care of TMJ and orofacial pain patients. The importance of a thorough pretreatment assessment is emphasized. Treatment options for oral habits, stress management, and other psychosocial challenges are briefly discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
